0 -16 Td
(resistance are horizontal lines, while supply and demand zones are areas where) Tj
0 -16 Td
(institutional orders cluster. To identify a demand zone, find a strong bullish move) Tj
0 -16 Td
(that left a base of one to three candles before the impulse. Draw a rectangle from) Tj
0 -16 Td
(the low of the base to the open of the last bearish candle before the rally. This) Tj
0 -16 Td
(zone represents unfilled buy orders. When price returns to this zone, institutional) Tj
0 -16 Td
(buyers step in again, creating a high-probability entry. Fresh zones that have not) Tj
0 -16 Td
